            <note corresp="#d490-f3" n="41" xml:id="d490-f3-content">
                <p>For text of the speech made by Mr. Russell, Chief, Division of World Trade
                    Intelligence, at a meeting of the American Drug Manufacturers Association on May
                    4, 1944, at Hot Springs, Virginia, see Department of State <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Bulletin</hi>, May 6, 1944, p. 405.</p>
            </note>
